          "Small-scale IsoFLOP pilot sweeps ranging across `10^18` to `10^20` FLOPs empirically verify those `C = 120 * N^2` frontier exponents locally before committing multi-million-dollar GPU hours on target architectures and proprietary tokenizer vocabularies.",
