          "Ring All-Reduce arranges N participating GPUs in a logical circular ring where each GPU communicates only with its immediate predecessor and successor.",
          "The operation is divided into two sequential phases: Scatter-Reduce (where partial gradient chunks are accumulated) and All-Gather (where final sums are distributed).",
