          "The ZeRO stage memory calculator evaluates static VRAM requirements per GPU across all three sharding stages.",
          "Under baseline DDP (Stage 0), each GPU requires the full sixteen bytes per parameter: `2B params + 2B grads + 12B optimizer`.",
