          "Notice one subtle positional encoding cleanup paired alongside block-diagonal causal masks: *RoPE rotary position ID resets*! Alongside resetting attention visibility at `<EOS>`, resetting positional token index `position_ids` back to `0` (`[0..len_A-1, 0..len_B-1, ...]`) at every packed document start ensures `Doc B` begins cleanly at position `0` instead of pretending to start at distant offset `pos = 4127`! Both positional hygiene and `cu_seqlens` boundary masking guarantee mathematically identical forward/backward gradients compared to unpadded variable-length single-document steps.",
